@startuml PasswordStateMachine
title Complex Password Detector State Diagram

state "Scan Characters" as Scan
state "Accept" as Accept
state "Reject" as Reject

[*] --> Scan

Scan --> Scan : [A-Z] / seenUpper=true, lastWasSpecial=false
Scan --> Scan : [!@#$%&*] / seenSpecial=true, lastWasSpecial=true
Scan --> Scan : [other] / lastWasSpecial=false

Scan --> Accept : [end and len>=8 and seenUpper and seenSpecial and not lastWasSpecial]
Scan --> Reject : [end and not(len>=8 and seenUpper and seenSpecial and not lastWasSpecial)]

Accept --> [*]
Reject --> [*]

note right of Scan
Length is checked in context, not by adding counting states.
end note
@enduml
